{"id":"n69019-2-8","stage":3,"title":"운 · 运气","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69019-2-8-1","ko":"지수야, 너 어제 교통사고 났었다며. 안 다쳤어?","zh":"智秀，我听说你昨天出了车祸对吧？没受伤吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교통사고","meaning":"交通事故","explanation":"교통사고：交通事故","readings":[{"term":"교통사고","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35968","senseId":"1","lemma":"교통사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났었다며.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"28bb225f685ceba3","term":"교통사고","zh":"交通事故","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3","entryId":"35968","definition":"汽车或火车等与其他交通工具相撞或撞到人的事故。","pronunciation":["교통사고"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b476843aa4884b47fe88.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69019-2-8-2","ko":"응. 운이 좋았는지 난 안 다치고 차만 망가졌어.","zh":"嗯。运气不错，我没受伤，只是车坏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운이","meaning":"运气","explanation":"운：运气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운","audio":"/audio/5c09e577c01e8a279cd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69019","senseId":"2","lemma":"운","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋았는지","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다치고","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차만","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"망가졌어.","meaning":"被破坏，被打碎，被弄坏，被整坏","explanation":"망가지다：被破坏，被打碎，被弄坏，被整坏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"망가지다","audio":"/audio/d27eddcc5a2cbfb591c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51597","senseId":"1","lemma":"망가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"5c09e577c01e8a27","term":"운","zh":"运气","audio":"/audio/5c09e577c01e8a279cd5.mp3","entryId":"69019","definition":"某事被实现的运数。","pronunciation":["운ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"d27eddcc5a2cbfb5","term":"망가지다","zh":"被破坏，被打碎，被弄坏，被整坏","audio":"/audio/d27eddcc5a2cbfb591c0.mp3","entryId":"51597","definition":"被打碎、砸破或让某物发生故障而使其完全无法使用。","pronunciation":["망가지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0151fef22e9f5c5b81f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.877,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69019","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.6023,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀，我听说你昨天出了车祸对吧？没受伤吧？","嗯。运气不错，我没受伤，只是车坏了。","智秀，你知道这个汉字是什么意思吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，我听说你昨天出了车祸对吧？没受伤吧？","嗯。运气不错，我没受伤，只是车坏了。","智秀，你知道这个汉字是什么意思吗？"],"answer":1}]}
